 A quotation that survives all four guards. The work is present, it
 hashes to the digest it was quoted by, it is signed by a key THIS SOURCE
 pinned as trusted, and that key scores 10000 against a floor of 5000.
 Only then is sort-ascending a name this chapter may use. The trusted key
 is named here in the source, not in the offered works below: the works
 arrive over a transport, and a transport must not be able to vouch for
 its own cargo.

Section: Body

  opening : [Console] Nothing
  opening = act
    print-line-uni ("sorted=" & show (sort-ascending 5))
  end

